273
00:15:33,050 --> 00:15:34,520
Yikes!

274
00:15:36,630 --> 00:15:37,400
Ah!

275
00:15:45,060 --> 00:15:45,870
It's nothing.

276
00:15:47,580 --> 00:15:50,520
Then why don't you ever get a girlfriend?

277
00:15:51,130 --> 00:15:51,890
Me?

278
00:15:55,010 --> 00:15:57,370
Honestly, I'm not even sure myself.

279
00:15:57,620 --> 00:15:58,680
How should I put it?

280
00:15:59,140 --> 00:16:00,470
I'm waiting for someone

281
00:16:00,640 --> 00:16:03,330
who makes me feel, "This is my person."

282
00:16:04,620 --> 00:16:07,480
So when I started college, I decided
not to get a girlfriend just yet.

283
00:16:07,480 --> 00:16:09,290
Instead, I'd make lots of female friends.

284
00:16:09,290 --> 00:16:12,230
Isn't it nice when everyone can
just have fun and joke around together?

285
00:16:12,230 --> 00:16:13,880
Think about it. Boyfriends, girlfriends,

286
00:16:13,880 --> 00:16:15,190
love triangles, possessive partners...

287
00:16:15,190 --> 00:16:16,930
It's even more trouble
than back in high school.

288
00:16:16,930 --> 00:16:17,940
So...

289
00:16:17,960 --> 00:16:19,630
I just wish I could mute
everyone around me,

290
00:16:19,630 --> 00:16:21,840
like you can on social media.

291
00:16:23,480 --> 00:16:25,200
That's what I do.

292
00:16:25,230 --> 00:16:26,350
I mute them.

293
00:16:27,050 --> 00:16:29,440
Really? How do you do that?

294
00:16:35,350 --> 00:16:37,830
I just focus on the things I like.

295
00:16:39,760 --> 00:16:41,020
The things you like...

296
00:16:57,900 --> 00:16:58,630
Huh?

297
00:17:06,200 --> 00:17:07,930
I think I'll walk home instead.

298
00:17:09,069 --> 00:17:09,819
Huh?

299
00:17:09,849 --> 00:17:10,460
See ya.

300
00:17:10,480 --> 00:17:11,220
Hey, wait!

301
00:17:27,400 --> 00:17:29,800
No one's ever
looked at me like that before.

302
00:17:30,560 --> 00:17:33,760
His eyes were filled with
such tenderness and affection.

303
00:17:35,410 --> 00:17:36,680
Could it be...

304
00:17:37,010 --> 00:17:39,500
Issei actually has feelings for me...

305
00:17:42,940 --> 00:17:45,320
No, no, no. Impossible.

306
00:17:45,340 --> 00:17:46,740
Absolutely impossible!

307
00:17:47,420 --> 00:17:48,920
Absolutely impossible.

308
00:17:53,410 --> 00:17:55,010
Ren, where are you going?

309
00:17:55,040 --> 00:17:56,730
Oh, out for a run.

310
00:17:56,750 --> 00:17:58,750
Oh.

311
00:17:59,470 --> 00:18:01,870
Wait, going running
after taking a shower?

312
00:18:22,630 --> 00:18:25,530
We agreed this was
just an act. Just an act!

313
00:18:25,560 --> 00:18:27,790
Oh, come on!

314
00:18:27,810 --> 00:18:29,110
Ah!

315
00:18:29,130 --> 00:18:31,370
Ugh, this is so annoying.

316
00:18:32,110 --> 00:18:32,940
Ah!

317
00:18:32,960 --> 00:18:34,740
I just want to take things
slow and enjoy the feeling.

318
00:18:34,740 --> 00:18:36,390
Yeah.

319
00:18:36,420 --> 00:18:39,240
-One step at a time.
-Right, one step at a time.

320
00:18:40,060 --> 00:18:42,310
Do you prefer me
with long hair or short hair?

321
00:18:42,310 --> 00:18:42,950
Which one?

322
00:18:43,270 --> 00:18:44,730
Which looks better?

323
00:18:46,920 --> 00:18:48,780
I think both styles would suit you.

324
00:18:48,780 --> 00:18:50,880
Aw, you're such a smooth talker!

325
00:18:50,900 --> 00:18:51,990
Ren.

326
00:18:52,020 --> 00:18:53,360
Have you finished your report?

327
00:18:53,360 --> 00:18:54,740
Oh, not yet.

328
00:18:54,770 --> 00:18:56,370
By the way, I have work today.

329
00:18:57,890 --> 00:18:58,850
What about hair color?

330
00:18:58,850 --> 00:19:03,240
-Do I look better blonde or black?
-Exactly! Exactly!

331
00:19:03,280 --> 00:19:03,830
What?

332
00:19:03,850 --> 00:19:04,870
Blonde or...

333
00:19:04,890 --> 00:19:06,260
Welcome!

334
00:19:06,290 --> 00:19:07,540
Thank you. Come again!

335
00:19:07,540 --> 00:19:08,950
I'd like some pancakes.

336
00:19:08,980 --> 00:19:10,600
One order of pancakes.

337
00:19:10,620 --> 00:19:12,200
Could you take this, please?

338
00:19:12,200 --> 00:19:13,410
Sure.

339
00:19:13,430 --> 00:19:16,390
Why am I stuck working in the kitchen?

340
00:19:21,750 --> 00:19:23,120
Thank you.

341
00:19:23,140 --> 00:19:25,100
-Watch your step, please.
-Okay.

342
00:19:25,670 --> 00:19:26,910
Sorry to keep you waiting.

343
00:19:26,910 --> 00:19:28,150
-Here's your order.
-Thank you.

344
00:19:28,150 --> 00:19:30,740
-Thanks! You're still so handsome today!
-You're too kind.

345
00:19:30,740 --> 00:19:31,390
Hahaha!

346
00:19:31,420 --> 00:19:31,960
Thank you for coming!

347
00:19:31,960 --> 00:19:33,560
Thank you for always taking
such good care of me.

348
00:19:33,560 --> 00:19:35,130
Oh, I'm still missing one matcha salad.

349
00:19:35,130 --> 00:19:36,970
-Oh, sorry! Thank you.
-Oh, really?

350
00:19:36,970 --> 00:19:38,310
Wait a moment, please.

351
00:19:38,330 --> 00:19:40,310
You're so handsome!

352
00:19:49,120 --> 00:19:50,740
I love this! I really do!

353
00:19:50,760 --> 00:19:52,470
Amazing!

354
00:19:52,940 --> 00:19:56,100
-Your turn!
-What're you doing?

355
00:19:56,130 --> 00:19:57,600
-Go for it!
-Go for it!

356
00:19:57,630 --> 00:19:59,240
-Come on!
-Say something!

357
00:19:59,270 --> 00:20:01,670
-Let's toast to today!
-Cheers!

358
00:20:01,700 --> 00:20:02,680
All right!

359
00:20:02,710 --> 00:20:04,930
-Cheers!
-Cheers!

360
00:20:04,960 --> 00:20:07,440
Whenever I'm with that guy,

361
00:20:07,460 --> 00:20:09,910
I'm always stuck playing second fiddle.

362
00:20:09,930 --> 00:20:11,480
What are you talking about?

363
00:20:11,500 --> 00:20:13,870
Stop! Don't say another word.

364
00:20:14,520 --> 00:20:15,270
Um...

365
00:20:15,300 --> 00:20:16,600
-So pretty!
-Hahaha!

366
00:20:17,940 --> 00:20:20,220
Everyone, listen up!

367
00:20:21,910 --> 00:20:23,530
Really beautiful.

368
00:20:23,560 --> 00:20:26,310
Yeah, only a freshman.

369
00:20:26,340 --> 00:20:28,420
I'm serious. I really mean it.

370
00:20:28,450 --> 00:20:29,670
-Really?
-Hey.

371
00:20:29,700 --> 00:20:32,850
Can we exchange contacts?

372
00:20:32,880 --> 00:20:34,490
Oh, sure!

373
00:20:34,510 --> 00:20:35,740
Ah, me too.

374
00:20:35,760 --> 00:20:36,430
One more year.

375
00:20:36,430 --> 00:20:36,760
Done.

376
00:20:36,770 --> 00:20:37,520
Did you get it?

377
00:20:37,520 --> 00:20:38,200
Got it.

378
00:20:38,220 --> 00:20:38,990
Thanks.

379
00:20:39,010 --> 00:20:39,740
Oh, I'm Ren.

380
00:20:39,760 --> 00:20:41,160
Okay, thanks.

381
00:20:41,180 --> 00:20:42,060
Let me help you.

382
00:20:42,090 --> 00:20:44,320
You're a cosmetology student, right?
Yeah, a cosmetology student.

383
00:20:44,320 --> 00:20:45,230
Thanks.

384
00:20:45,260 --> 00:20:49,400
Just dye it red. That's all.

385
00:20:58,310 --> 00:21:01,380
What? He hasn't even contacted me.

386
00:21:03,860 --> 00:21:05,960
I feel like such an idiot.

387
00:21:14,640 --> 00:21:15,700
Morning!

388
00:21:15,720 --> 00:21:17,490
Thanks for coming
to the mixer the other day.

389
00:21:17,490 --> 00:21:18,450
No, I should be thanking you.

390
00:21:18,450 --> 00:21:20,970
Oh, how are things going
with that girl from before?

391
00:21:20,970 --> 00:21:22,100
It's not happening.

392
00:21:22,120 --> 00:21:24,160
How about you?
Why aren't you with Kuji today?

393
00:21:24,160 --> 00:21:25,580
Oh, it's nothing.

394
00:21:25,600 --> 00:21:27,170
Hahaha!

395
00:21:27,190 --> 00:21:28,770
Oh, come on!

396
00:21:28,800 --> 00:21:31,410
That look on his face...

397
00:21:33,880 --> 00:21:35,350
Aren't you going to go say hi?

398
00:21:35,350 --> 00:21:36,850
I told you, it's nothing!

399
00:21:36,870 --> 00:21:38,800
I'm going for it!

400
00:21:38,820 --> 00:21:41,560
I mean it. I've decided to take a chance.

401
00:21:41,590 --> 00:21:42,740
Thank you. Seriously, thank you!

402
00:21:42,740 --> 00:21:44,140
I've decided to go all in.

403
00:21:46,990 --> 00:21:47,890
Hey!

404
00:21:53,460 --> 00:21:55,360
That's my spot.

405
00:22:06,160 --> 00:22:07,550
I mean...

406
00:22:07,800 --> 00:22:09,690
Issei is my partner.

407
00:22:09,710 --> 00:22:10,930
Right?

408
00:22:12,170 --> 00:22:13,230
Hehe.

409
00:22:13,250 --> 00:22:14,790
What's going on?

410
00:22:14,810 --> 00:22:17,590
You don't have to be so lovey-dovey.
We get it already!

411
00:22:17,590 --> 00:22:19,560
You scared me, suddenly
going all out like that. Cut it out!

412
00:22:19,560 --> 00:22:20,690
Hehe. My bad, my bad.

413
00:22:22,270 --> 00:22:24,470
You can borrow my report and take a look.

414
00:22:24,680 --> 00:22:26,330
You haven't even
started writing yours yet, have you?

415
00:22:26,330 --> 00:22:28,190
Hey, Issei.

416
00:22:39,690 --> 00:22:42,870
What's this? A kabedon?

417
00:22:43,150 --> 00:22:46,610
There's no one here. What's
the point of putting on such a show?

418
00:22:49,000 --> 00:22:50,330
I didn't know back then.

419
00:22:54,240 --> 00:22:56,840
I didn't know you were
pretending to be asleep.

420
00:22:59,220 --> 00:23:01,280
I had no idea you were actually awake.

421
00:23:02,780 --> 00:23:05,640
I only kissed you because I
thought you were asleep.

422
00:23:13,340 --> 00:23:14,770
Guess why.

423
00:23:38,080 --> 00:23:39,640
What are you doing?

424
00:23:40,170 --> 00:23:41,090
Listen...

425
00:23:41,110 --> 00:23:44,040
There's not a single person
watching. If you do this,

426
00:23:44,050 --> 00:23:46,850
people will laugh
their heads off if they find out.

427
00:23:49,380 --> 00:23:51,830
Then why not stop treating it like a joke?

428
00:23:56,400 --> 00:23:58,210
Oh, I see.

429
00:23:59,090 --> 00:24:01,950
Then let's do it once.
This time, I'll do it your way.

430
00:24:02,230 --> 00:24:05,830
Once I've given you what you want,
you have to forget all about it.

431
00:24:06,420 --> 00:24:07,300
Oh, but...

432
00:24:08,780 --> 00:24:09,460
I...

433
00:24:09,920 --> 00:24:11,920
I don't know how to hold another guy.

434
00:24:17,620 --> 00:24:18,950
It's okay, Ren.

435
00:24:20,260 --> 00:24:22,120
You don't have to hold back at all.

436
00:24:43,310 --> 00:24:45,600
About what happened yesterday...

437
00:24:43,640 --> 00:24:47,030
[Coming Up Next]

438
00:24:45,620 --> 00:24:46,590
Huh? What?

439
00:24:47,720 --> 00:24:48,570
Huh? What?

440
00:24:48,600 --> 00:24:49,760
Am I a mosquito or something?

441
00:24:49,760 --> 00:24:52,220
To him, was it just like
getting bitten by a mosquito?

442
00:24:52,220 --> 00:24:53,720
That Ren, honestly...

443
00:24:53,740 --> 00:24:55,380
Ah.

444
00:24:55,400 --> 00:24:56,710
Let the show begin!

445
00:24:55,860 --> 00:24:56,770
[Let the Show Begin]

446
00:24:56,740 --> 00:24:58,820
Come inside and wash off all that filth.

447
00:24:58,820 --> 00:25:00,240
Does this guy

448
00:24:59,960 --> 00:25:03,000
[This drama is entirely fictional]

449
00:25:00,270 --> 00:25:01,960
belong to me now?
